<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify your email</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f9fafb; margin: 0; padding: 40px 0; }
        .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); text-align: center; }
        .brand { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5057f3 0%, #00f2fe 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .code-box { background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #5057f3; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 30px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="brand">Readory</div>
    <p>Hello <strong><%= locals.username || locals.context?.username || 'User' %></strong>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering. Please use the following code to verify your email address:</p>
    <div class="code-box"><%= locals.code || locals.context?.code %></div>
    <p>This code will expire in 2 minutes.</p>
    <div class="footer">If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>